The '''Time Chamber''' is a [[Location]] in the [[Rift Dimension]] where players fight {{NPCSprite|Sun Gecko}}.

== Purpose ==
{{Main|Sun Gecko}}
The '''Time Chamber''' is an arena where the player can fight {{NPCSprite|Sun Gecko}} for {{Item|Sun Gecko Essence}}. {{Item|Sun Gecko Essence}} can be spent at {{NPCSprite|Oruo The Almighty}} for special items and perks.

